title: "On the Polysemanticity of the V Neuron: code, pre-registrations and results"
abstract: >-
  Two pre-registered tests of whether InceptionV1's "V neuron" (mixed4e:55) and its largest input,
  mixed4d:493 (the "fox snout" channel), detect V shapes, by varying shape and content independently.
